sequenceDiagram
  actor Op as Operator
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant Ctl as Controller
  participant Db as Policy + Revision
  participant Gw as OpenShell gateway
  Op->>UI: edit network rule
  UI->>Ctl: PATCH /api/v1/policies/{id}/
  Ctl->>Db: store YAML, bump version, keep revision
  Ctl->>Ctl: validate against schema
  Ctl->>Gw: set_policy(name, yaml)
  Gw-->>Ctl: applied
  Ctl-->>UI: new effective policy
  Note over Gw: network sections hot-reload<br/>filesystem/process need a new nest
